---
title: Program packs
description: "Share training programs coaches can copy into their own with a program pack: plain JSON, no code."
---

A program pack offers **training programs** that coaches copy into their own, from
Programs › Start from a program › Community. Like the other packs it's pure JSON — no code,
no sandbox. Copying makes the coach's own program: a newer version of your pack never
changes a program a coach already copied, or a client's copy of it.

## The pack file

```json
{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "pluginId": "com.you.upper-lower",
  "programs": [
    {
      "name": "Upper / lower",
      "description": "4 days a week for lifters with a year or more behind them.",
      "rule": { "kind": "adaptive" },
      "weeks": [
        {
          "id": "w1",
          "weekNumber": 1,
          "days": [
            {
              "id": "d1",
              "orderIndex": 0,
              "name": "Upper A",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "strength",
                  "id": "b1",
                  "orderIndex": 0,
                  "exerciseName": "Bench Press",
                  "sets": [
                    { "id": "s1", "orderIndex": 0, "setType": "normal", "repsMin": 6, "repsMax": 8 }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

- Each program is a LogIt program: `weeks` of `days` of `blocks`. Blocks are `strength`
  (with `sets`), `cardio`, `circuit`, `mobility` or `plugin`.
- **`rule`** (optional, default fixed): how the numbers move week to week. `adaptive`
  (LogIt Adaptive), `linear` (with `stepKg`), `wave`, or `fixed`.
- Ids only need to be unique inside the pack; they're replaced when a coach copies it.
- Up to 20 programs, 52 weeks each, 7 days a week and 40 blocks a day.
